{"id":"prognat_","lemma":"прогнать","pos":"verb","rank":4842,"glosses":["to drive (cattle)","to chase away","to cause to disappear, to banish"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/ae/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"future":{"1s":"прогоню","2s":"прогонишь","3s":"прогонит","1p":"прогоним","2p":"прогоните","3p":"прогонят"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"прогони","2p":"прогоните"}}},"past":{"m":"прогнал","p":"прогнали","f":"прогнала","n":"прогнало"},"aspect":"perfective","aspectPartner":"прогонять","examples":[{"text":"Он прогнал собаку.","en":"He drove the dog away.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,null]},{"text":"Мы хотим прогнать несколько тестов.","en":"We want to run a few tests.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},null,{"g":"somewhat"},{"g":"test","l":"тест"}]},{"text":"Том прогнал кошек.","en":"Tom chased the cats away.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,null]},{"text":"Тома прогнали со сцены улюлюканьем.","en":"Tom got booed off the stage.","words":[{"g":"volume","l":"том"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"stage, scene","l":"сцена"},null]},{"text":"Том прогнал Мэри.","en":"Tom sent Mary away.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,null]}]}